.Sh CAVEATS
.ad l
This program is written in AppleScript,
and thus only works on macOS systems.
.Pp
.Xr jq 1
and
.Xr PlistBuddy 1
.Pq located at Pa /usr/libexec/PlistBuddy
are used to parse the JSON and XML output of
.Xr system_profiler 8 ,
respectively.
In the latter's case,
a temporary file is created in
.Ev TMPDIR
in order for
.Nm PlistBuddy
to be able to read it,
as discussed in the
.Sx FILES
section.
